		{
			"id":"a26dea5700a7d3f7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Ovinn Nevarei\n\n**Towards a new future** ??\n\nJor = Name\nLor = Word",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":7780,
			"width":380,
			"height":225
		},
		{
			"id":"0d2d7164894414d4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Sam left his house at 6 am and drove five hours\nwest and passed 8 flags. He then turned north at\nTanner Fork and drove two hours north and passed 4\nflags of the same color before arriving at Trinsdale at\nnoon. What color were the flags?\n\nA - WHITE\nB - BLACK\n**C - RED**\nD - YELLOW",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3320,
			"y":10280,
			"width":520,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"9511da82f8a72d57",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"2. In the scenario above, where does Sam live?\n\n**A - ORIS**\nB - THE GRAND CITY OF FENN\nC - ARCH ARIES\nD - ERAJA\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3320,
			"y":10605,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{"id":"24381aa715606e78","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/Obsidian_oTltJDBLiK.png","x":3900,"y":10640,"width":330,"height":400},
		{"id":"d671060ad61d9984","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_wlUK6I1tsP.png","x":3900,"y":10380,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"34ac189731808e8f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"3. What color is most often associated with Hallways?\n \nA - VIOLET\nB - RED\nC - WHITE\n**D - ORANGE**\n\n4. Which of the following would be the least patriotic\nroom pairing?\n\nA - CHAPEL IN FENN ARIES\nB - SHOP IN ARCH ARIES\n**C - A GREENHOUSE IN CORARICA**\nD - A BEDROOM IN ERAJA\n\n\n\n5. What color is the fruit that gives you +3 steps when\nconsumed?\n\n**A - YELLOW (3)**\nB - ORANGE (5)\nC - RED OR GREEN (2)\nD - ONLY GREEN (2)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3320,
			"y":10860,
			"width":520,
			"height":540
		},
