		{
			"id":"e518cfa1189ebc54",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Inn Ett Iss - North East South\n\n**Ett Trei - East Tree**\n\nAjinn Ett Ovtrei Issja Treivo - \nFirst North East Toward Tree, South Last Away From Tree (Old Answer - Incorrect probably)\n\nMainn Ettam Matrei Ettiss Maorr - \nSmall North, Long East, Small Tree, South East, Small West",
